# Kakao Theme Studio — environment example
#
# Phase 1 (current) needs NO environment variables: everything runs in the browser
# and stores work locally in IndexedDB. Nothing here is read by the app yet.
#
# Phase 2 placeholders (Firebase web config is public by design, but never put
# server secrets, Firebase Admin credentials or Kakao client secrets in VITE_ vars —
# they are bundled into client code).
# VITE_FIREBASE_API_KEY=
# VITE_FIREBASE_AUTH_DOMAIN=
# VITE_FIREBASE_PROJECT_ID=
# VITE_FIREBASE_STORAGE_BUCKET=
# VITE_FIREBASE_APP_ID=
